{"id": "06", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Meanwhile, Granny opened a cookie stand. [pause] Just a little one."}, {"speaker": "GRANDMA", "text": "[sweet] Fresh cookies! Two coins! [pause] Three for the cute ones!"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Then a bakery. Then a factory. [pause] Then a skyscraper."}, {"speaker": "GRANDMA", "text": "[sweetly] Cookies are now five coins. [pause] Ten coins on weekends. [pause] Fifteen if you're rude."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "She hired your friends. [pause] Then she hired your friends' friends."}, {"speaker": "NOODLE", "text": "[cheerful] Sorry, bro! She pays double! [pause] And there's dental!"}, {"speaker": "GRANDMA", "text": "[sweetly] I bought your castle, dear. [pause] It was a very good deal."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[shocked] You BOUGHT my base?!"}, {"speaker": "GRANDMA", "text": "[sweet, firm] You can still live there. [pause] Rent is fifty coins a week."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[pleading] Granny! I'm your grandson!"}, {"speaker": "GRANDMA", "text": "[sweetly] That's why it's only fifty, dear."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[deadpan] You had twelve coins."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 4.12, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 67, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "pFZP5JQG7iQjIQuC4Bku", "start_time_seconds": 4.12, "end_time_seconds": 9.44, "character_start_index": 67, "character_end_index": 133, "dialogue_input_index": 1}, {"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 9.44, "end_time_seconds": 14.52, "character_start_index": 133, "character_end_index": 190, "dialogue_input_index": 2}, {"voice_id": "pFZP5JQG7iQjIQuC4Bku", "start_time_seconds": 14.52, "end_time_seconds": 21.759999999999998, "character_start_index": 190, "character_end_index": 290, "dialogue_input_index": 3}, {"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 21.759999999999998